---
import Doc from '../layouts/Doc.astro';
import site from '../site.config.ts';
---
<Doc
  title="Contact RateRunner"
  seoTitle="Contact RateRunner: Corrections, Data Questions, Partners"
  description="How to reach RateRunner about a data error, a corridor you want covered, a press or partnership question, or a privacy request. One email address, read by a person."
  path="/contact/"
  lede={`Email ${site.contactEmail}. That address handles corrections, data questions, corridor requests, partnership enquiries and privacy requests.`}
  updated="2026-10-15"
>
  <h2>Reporting a data error</h2>
  <p>Please include the page URL, the corridor and amount, and what you believe is wrong. If you have a quote from a provider that differs from the table, the time you saw it helps: quotes move during the day and each RateRunner figure carries its own collection time.</p>
  <h2>Corridor requests</h2>
  <p>RateRunner covers 40 corridors chosen for transfer volume and data availability. Requests for new corridors are welcome; a corridor is added only when the comparison data returns at least four usable quotes.</p>
  <h2>Providers and partnerships</h2>
  <p>Providers cannot pay to change their position. Ranking is always by what the recipient gets. Affiliate or advertising enquiries are welcome on that basis.</p>
  <h2>Privacy requests</h2>
  <p>For questions about data collected by analytics or advertising on this site, see the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> or write to the same address.</p>
  <p><a class="mail" href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a></p>
</Doc>
<style>.mail { font: 600 var(--t-lg) var(--mono); }</style>
